# No PR Approval or Merge by Agent

The agent MUST NOT run any command or API call that approves or merges a pull request.

Forbidden: `gh pr merge`, `gh pr review --approve`,
`gh api …/pulls/…/reviews` (POST, APPROVE/DISMISS),
`gh api …/pulls/…/merge` (PUT).

The agent may create PRs, list them, view checks, and push branches.
Approval and merge are exclusively the human user's decision.
If instructed to merge or approve, explain that this is a human-only action and stop.
